    "title" "Viewpoint Extraction Support"
    "description" "
[h1]Viewpoint Extraction Support[/h1]
Displays configurable helicopter models during Extraction Mode pickups in Project Viewpoint.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Shows a selected helicopter during final approach, boarding and departure. Each extraction randomly chooses from selected models that are installed and available.
[*]Supports the seven aircraft available through Visible Helicopter Events: UH-1B Huey, MH-92 Nightfang, Little Bird, Chinook, Black Hawk, UH-1 Huey and AH-1 SuperCobra.
[*]Optionally supports FTZ Hummingbird, Orca and Hellcat. FTZ Helicopters also requires FTZ Flying.
[*]Adds positional extraction audio, 3D extraction areas, terrain-following boarding markers, and the Board Extraction Helicopter interaction in Viewpoint.
[*]Shows the destination and countdown during deployment, and warns raid participants when the next horde is one in-game hour away.
[*]Optionally hides the Extraction Mode HUD unless an inventory or loot window is open, and optionally applies NeatUI styling when NeatUI_Framework is installed.
[*]Adds a custom 3D model and inventory icon for Extraction Mode's flare gun, with a glowing red signal and smoke trail visible in Viewpoint. The cosmetic effect does not create fire or change extraction behavior.
[*]Fixes missing hideout wall surfaces in the Viewpoint beta when a short Bunker or Railroad panel is selected on the reverse face of a full height wall.
[/list]

[h2]Requirements[/h2]
[list]
[*]Project Zomboid Build 42.21+
[*]Extraction Mode
[*]Project Viewpoint
[*]ZombieBuddy 2.3.4+
[*]Visible Helicopter Events
[/list]
Aircraft mods are optional. UH-1B Helicopter requires Aviation Core. FTZ aircraft require FTZ Helicopters and FTZ Flying. Keep Show event aircraft enabled in Visible Helicopter Events.

[h2]Optional companion[/h2]
The ProjectRPGExpanded PDA interface is available separately: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831366933]Extraction Mode PDA Integration[/url]. It requires ProjectRPGExpanded.

Extraction timing, boarding rules, zombie attraction and server synchronization remain owned by Extraction Mode. The flare gun keeps its original ammunition, sound and extraction behavior. In multiplayer, flare visuals are relayed to nearby players when this addon is installed on the server and clients.

Workshop ID: 3827358939
Mod ID: ViewpointExtractionSupport
"
    "changenote" "0.1.25: Adds a custom flare gun model, inventory icon and red smoke signal effect. Also reduces the weapon size by 15% and includes visual and multiplayer fixes."
}